* From J. C. Shaw, "JOSS: A Designer's View of an Experimental On-Line Computing System", RAND P-2922, August 1964, figure 3h.
4.1 Demand b(i).
4.2 Set s = s+b(i).

Set s=0.
Do part 4 for i=1(1)4.
    b(1) = 543
    b(2) = 237
    b(3) = 411
    b(4) = 733
Type s.
       s =   1924
5.1 Set b(i) = b(i)/s.
Do part 5 for i=1(1)4.
Type b.
    b(1) =       .282224532
    b(2) =       .123180873
    b(3) =       .213617464
    b(4) =       .380977131
Set s=0.
Do step 4.2 for i=1(1)4.
Type s.
       s =      1
Delete all.
